rite\":\"First-write prerequisites satisfied; changed-source evidence may be invalidated.\",\"current_versions\":{\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":\"9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9\",\"deepinfer/environ.py\":\"27b5bd1b6a41e60de9289072b9b49be7262009422fb14f56bc112dd81ae6783c\",\"deepinfer/logger.py\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\"},\"applied_writes\":{\"deepinfer/environ.py\":\"27b5bd1b6a41e60de9289072b9b49be7262009422fb14f56bc112dd81ae6783c\"},\"verified_versions\":[],\"required_mechanisms_exposed\":{\"deepinfer/environ.py\":{\"exposed\":0,\"registered\":0},\"deepinfer/logger.py\":{\"exposed\":3,\"registered\":3},\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":{\"exposed\":4,\"registered\":4}}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now applying the environ.py edit: a bounded int-or-none factory plus the new logging config entry.\n\n```python\nenviron_hash = \"fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218\"\nr = replace_text_batch(\"deepinfer/environ.py\", [\n {\"old_text\": '''def _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n''',\n  \"new_text\": '''def _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n\n\ndef _int_or_none_at_least(v: str | None, minimum: int) -> int | None:\n    \"\"\"未设置时返回 None（不限），否则解析为 >= minimum 的整数。\"\"\"\n    if v is None:\n        return None\n    parsed = int(v)\n    if parsed < minimum:\n        raise ValueError(f\"{parsed} must be >= {minimum}\")\n    return parsed\n'''},\n {\"old_text\": '''    @staticmethod\n    def int_or_none() -> EnvVar[int | None]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: int(v) if v is not None else None)\n''',\n  \"new_text\": '''    @staticmethod\n    def int_or_none() -> EnvVar[int | None]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: int(v) if v is not None else None)\n\n    @s